o]] [[the]] [[grass]], [[but]] [[Dad]] [[called|call]] [[him]] [[back]]. [[Above]] [[the]] [[grass]], [[he]] [[could]] [[see]] [[the]] [[window]] [[of]] [[the]] [[little]] [[room]]. [[The]] [[plant]] [[in]] [[it]] [[was|be]] [[green]] [[and]] [[fresh]], [[although]] [[it]] [[had|have]] [[not]] [[rained|rain]] [[for]] [[days|day]].`,`vn`:`S\u00e1ng h\u00f4m sau, Quang \u0111i v\u00f2ng ra ph\u00eda sau nh\u00e0. Sau nh\u00e0 c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t kho\u1ea3nh s\u00e2n nh\u1ecf, nh\u01b0ng \u0111\u00e3 nhi\u1ec1u n\u0103m kh\u00f4ng ai c\u1eaft c\u1ecf. C\u1ecf cao h\u01a1n c\u1ea3 Uy\u00ean, v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t lo\u1ea1i c\u00e2y d\u1ea1i ph\u1ee7 k\u00edn h\u00e0ng r\u00e0o c\u0169 v\u00e0 g\u1ea7n h\u1ebft b\u1ee9c t\u01b0\u1eddng sau nh\u00e0. Quang v\u1eeba b\u01b0\u1edbc m\u1ed9t ch\u00e2n v\u00e0o \u0111\u00e1m c\u1ecf th\u00ec b\u1ed1 g\u1ecdi gi\u1eadt l\u1ea1i. Ph\u00eda tr\u00ean \u0111\u00e1m c\u1ecf, c\u1eadu nh\u00ecn th\u1ea5y c\u1eeda s\u1ed5 c\u1ee7a c\u0103n ph\u00f2ng nh\u1ecf. Ch\u1eadu c\u00e2y b\u00ean c\u1eeda s\u1ed5 v\u1eabn xanh t\u01b0\u01a1i, d\u00f9 \u0111\u00e3 m\u1ea5y ng\u00e0y tr\u1eddi kh\u00f4ng m\u01b0a.`},{`en`:`[[Dad]] [[tied|tie]] [[a]] [[rope]] [[across]] [[the]] [[way]] [[into]] [[the]] [[yard]]. \`[[Nobody]] [[goes|go]] [[in]] [[there]] [[until]] [[I]] [[cut]] [[the]] [[grass]],\` [[he]] [[said|say]]. \`[[There]] [[could]] [[be]] [[snakes|snake]].\``,`vn`:`B\u1ed1 bu\u1ed9c m\u1ed9t s\u1ee3i d\u00e2y th\u1eebng ch\u1eafn ngang l\u1ed1i v\u00e0o s\u00e2n. \`Kh\u00f4ng ai \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3 cho t\u1edbi khi b\u1ed1 c\u1eaft c\u1ecf xong,\` b\u1ed1 n\u00f3i. \`C\u00f3 khi c\u00f3 r\u1eafn \u0111\u1ea5y.\``},{`en`:`[[That]] [[night]], [[Mum]] [[sat|sit]] [[at]] [[the]] [[table]] [[with]] [[a]] [[page]] [[of]] [[numbers|number]]. [[She]] [[was|be]] [[also]] [[finishing|finish]] [[the]] [[new]] [[curtains|curtain]], [[with]] [[a]] [[needle]] [[in]] [[her]] [[hand]] [[and]] [[three]] [[pins|pin]] [[in]] [[her]] [[mouth]]. [[Dad]] [[was|be]] [[painting]] [[a]] [[sign]] [[from]] [[a]] [[tube]] [[of]] [[blue]] [[paint]]. Uyen [[played|play]] [[with]] Miu [[and]] [[a]] [[piece]] [[of]] [[string]]. \`[[Let's|let]] [[talk]] [[about]] [[money]],\` [[Mum]] [[said|say]] [[through]] [[the]] [[pins|pin]]. [[Nobody]] [[understood|understand]] [[a]] [[word]], [[so]] [[she]] [[took|take]] [[them]] [[out]].`,`vn`:`T\u1ed1i \u0111\u00f3, m\u1eb9 ng\u1ed3i b\u00ean b\u00e0n v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t trang \u0111\u1ea7y nh\u1eefng con s\u1ed1. M\u1eb9 v\u1eeba t\u00ednh v\u1eeba may n\u1ed1t m\u1ea5y t\u1ea5m r\u00e8m m\u1edbi, tay c\u1ea7m kim, mi\u1ec7ng ng\u1eadm ba chi\u1ebfc ghim. B\u1ed1 \u0111ang s\u01a1n m\u1ed9t t\u1ea5m bi\u1ec3n b\u1eb1ng tu\u00fdp s\u01a1n xanh. Uy\u00ean ch\u01a1i v\u1edbi Miu v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t s\u1ee3i d\u00e2y. \`M\u00ecnh n\u00f3i chuy\u1ec7n ti\u1ec1n nong \u0111i,\` m\u1eb9 n\u00f3i qua m\u1ea5y chi\u1ebfc ghim. Ch\u1eb3ng ai hi\u1ec3u m\u1eb9 n\u00f3i g\u00ec, th\u1ebf l\u00e0 m\u1eb9 ph\u1ea3i b\u1ecf ghim ra.`},{`en`:`\`[[Our]] [[old]] [[accommodation]] [[was|be]] [[tiny]], [[and]] [[we]] [[paid|pay]] [[rent]] [[every]] [[month]],\` [[she]] [[said|say]]. \`[[Here]] [[there's|there]] [[no]] [[rent]]. [[But]] [[this]] [[house]] [[is|be]] [[old]]. [[The]] [[heating]] doesn't [[work]], [[and]] [[winters|winter]] [[here]] [[are|be]] [[cold]]. [[And]] [[the]] [[pipes|pipe]] [[make]] [[strange]] [[noises|noise]] [[at]] [[night]].\` \`[[Pipes|pipe]] [[always]] [[make]] [[noises|noise]],\` [[said|say]] [[Dad]]. \`[[Not]] [[like]] [[piano]] [[music]],\` [[said|say]] [[Mum]].`,`vn`:`\`Ch\u1ed7 \u1edf c\u0169 c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh b\u00e9 t\u00ed, m\u00e0 th\u00e1ng n\u00e0o c\u0169ng ph\u1ea3i tr\u1ea3 ti\u1ec1n thu\u00ea,\` m\u1eb9 n\u00f3i. \`\u1ede \u0111\u00e2y kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i tr\u1ea3 ti\u1ec1n thu\u00ea n\u1eefa. Nh\u01b0ng nh\u00e0 n\u00e0y c\u0169. H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng s\u01b0\u1edfi kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ea1y, m\u00e0 m\u00f9a \u0111\u00f4ng \u1edf \u0111\u00e2y th\u00ec l\u1ea